full_description: STAT-UP Statistical Consulting & Data Science GmbH is a consultancy headquartered in
Munich, specializing in statistics, data science, and applied AI. Founded in 2003,
STAT-UP has successfully delivered more than 1,500 projects for leading companies,
international organizations, and public institutions.

Combining deep statistical expertise with modern machine learning, AI, and data
engineering, STAT-UP transforms complex data into reliable insights and actionable
solutions. Our expertise spans predictive analytics, time series forecasting, causal
inference, and generative AI. Beyond consulting, we develop innovative tools for
privacy-preserving synthetic data generation, AI-assisted data quality analysis, and
advanced decision support.

What sets STAT-UP apart is our strong statistical foundation and our commitment to
trustworthy, explainable, and responsible AI. We bridge the gap between scientific
rigor and real-world application, helping organizations turn complex data and
emerging technologies into sound, evidence-based decisions.
